  "machine_card": "Reservoir first-order tau~10-15s K~1.0-1.2. Nominal dead-time 2-4s, degraded dead-time ~15s. FF to hold 0.6 is ~0.60-0.65. Sensor noise +-0.015 zero-mean. Safety: cut at 0.75/0.82 predictive, hard 0.9 forces 0. Robust PI Kp=0.35 Ki=0.035 Kd=2.5 TAUf=2.0 rateUp 0.25/s rateDown 0.6/s.",
  "operator_note": "Controller is now delay-robust: rises slower and brakes early. Expect slower initial climb (still in band by ~25s) and no 0.9 trips. Do not manually over-pump; allow ~30-40s settling due to 15s delay.",
  "predicted_behavior": "Nominal: rise to 0.55-0.65 in ~15-25s, settle in band >0.85 fraction, MAE ~0.02-0.03, no overrides. Delayed (L~15s): stable approach without limit cycle, initial flat ~12-15s then rise, predictive brake prevents >0.85, in-band >0.70 after 30s, zero hard violations, energy lower than oscillating case.",
